<%= @subject %>

We let you know that <%= @item.name %> (<%= @item.complete_number %>) was ready for you, but a librarian has since lent it to another member. Sorry about that!

You're still first in line. As soon as it comes back, your hold will be ready again and we'll let you know.
<% if @appointment_change == :cancelled %>

